      "message": "Hi Jaegeuk,\n\nWith this change, if all f2fs partitions are cleanly unmounted, we will never end up calling the ioctl F2FS_IOC_SHUTDOWN:\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/core/init/reboot.cpp;l\u003d818\n\nToday, this IOCTL is called during every reboot cycle as some partitions weren\u0027t cleany unmounted.\n\nPlease let know if this is ok.",
